    {
      "start_s": 5,
      "speaker": "p-beth",
      "text": "Okay, let's get started. We have a lot of people, so keep it tight. Arjun, actuators first."
    },
    {
      "start_s": 15,
      "speaker": "p-arjun",
      "text": "Uh, hip actuator rev B is through the efficiency sweep. Knee is a little behind, the wave generator hub needed a re-grind."
    },
    {
      "start_s": 35,
      "speaker": "p-beth",
      "text": "Okay. Priya, legs?"
    },
    {
      "start_s": 40,
      "speaker": "p-priya",
      "text": "Leg DVT build is on pace. Drop test fixture was shimmed and looks good now. Ankle is waiting on a few parts."
    },
    {
      "start_s": 65,
      "speaker": "p-sofia",
      "text": "Hands, finger creep test is at 80k cycles. Retension interval looks right, not seeing the 4 degree loss anymore."
    },
    {
      "start_s": 90,
      "speaker": "p-lukas",
      "text": "Structures, pelvis plates passed flatness, battery enclosure rev B is in the machine shop."
    },
    {
      "start_s": 115,
      "speaker": "p-farah",
      "text": "Electrical, driver board respin is out for fab. I think we're okay on schedule, not totally sure about the connector lead time."
    },
    {
      "start_s": 135,
      "speaker": "p-gwen",
      "text": "Connectors are on my list, I'll get you a date today."
    },
    {
      "start_s": 150,
      "speaker": "p-nora",
      "text": "Sorry, joining late. What did I miss?"
    },
    {
      "start_s": 155,
      "speaker": "p-beth",
      "text": "Just the first few, Nora, we'll circle back to you."
    },
    {
      "start_s": 175,
      "speaker": "p-beth",
      "text": "Okay, schedule. The Actuator DVT gate review is moving from the 13th to 10/14."
    },
    {
      "start_s": 190,
      "speaker": "p-ingrid",
      "text": "Why a day?"
    },
    {
      "start_s": 194,
      "speaker": "p-beth",
      "text": "Just the date, nothing else changes."
    },
    {
      "start_s": 205,
      "speaker": "p-arjun",
      "text": "That works for us, it actually gives me an extra day."
    },
    {
      "start_s": 220,
      "speaker": "p-dmitri",
      "text": "Test lab can be ready by then. We need the dyno free the day before."
    },
    {
      "start_s": 240,
      "speaker": "p-jonas",
      "text": "Firmware's okay with that, derate warning is merged."
    },
    {
      "start_s": 260,
      "speaker": "p-omar",
      "text": "I'll update the master schedule."
    },
    {
      "start_s": 285,
      "speaker": "p-nora",
      "text": "NPI side, we have the build slots, no change from my end."
    },
    {
      "start_s": 305,
      "speaker": "p-ingrid",
      "text": "Okay. Anything blocking? No? Thanks."
    }
